ans Explore.'),(10,5,'screen','An unlocked reward with its code, first come first served. Held 1.8 s with a slow zoom, then cut.','https://fwbhwfxpncrsfhttimna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/vegan-media/media/tours/green-leaf-tour/f53-c-code.jpg',11.04,12.86,'There are only so many,'),(10,6,'screen','A reward: a free cookie with any bowl. Held 2.3 s with a slow zoom, then cut.','https://fwbhwfxpncrsfhttimna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/vegan-media/media/tours/green-leaf-tour/f54-c-rw2.jpg',12.86,15.18,'first come, first served,'),(10,7,'screen','The Green Leaf Club, a Guide on Vegans Explore. Held 3.1 s with a slow zoom, then cut.','https://fwbhwfxpncrsfhttimna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/vegan-media/media/tours/green-leaf-tour/f55-c-club.jpg',15.18,18.3,'and your club is a Guide on Vegans Explore,'),(10,8,'screen','The club''s points and Join free. Held 2.3 s with a slow zoom, then cut.','https://fwbhwfxpncrsfhttimna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/vegan-media/media/tours/green-leaf-tour/f56-c-club2.jpg',18.3,20.62,'so it brings people in and sends them out to'),(10,9,'screen','Green Leaf Kitchen''s Vegans Explore page (sample). Held 2.0 s with a slow zoom, then cut.','https://fwbhwfxpncrsfhttimna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/vegan-media/media/tours/green-leaf-tour/f57-ve-listing.jpg',20.62,22.1518,'the rest of the community'),(11,1,'screen','The home page''s first screen: header, Open now, the headline. Held 2.5 s with a slow zoom, then cut.','https://fwbhwfxpncrsfhttimna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/vegan-media/media/tours/green-leaf-tour/f58-hero-top.jpg',0,2.48,'Want one like this for your restaurant?'),(11,2,'screen','The tour page: V, Play the tour and Talk to our team. Held 2.2 s with a slow zoom, then cut.','https://fwbhwfxpncrsfhttimna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/vegan-media/media/tours/green-leaf-tour/f59-tour-talk.jpg',2.48,4.72,'Tap Talk to our team and a real person'),(11,3,'illustration','V in the café with the tablet (her tour picture). Held 3.0 s with a slow zoom, then cut.','https://fwbhwfxpncrsfhttimna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/vegan-media/media/tours/green-leaf-tour/f60-V.jpg',4.72,6.3478,'will walk you through it')) v(ch,o,kind,brief,img,af,at,line) where t.slug='green-leaf-tour';
